   "does": "Builds the merged session from the newer remote copy: restores local HealthKit-only fields; keeps local sleep entirely when the remote has no sleep window, or keeps local sleepSnapshot when windows match; keeps local auto-window result when remote was user-adjusted without one; keeps local HealthKit export stamp when remote has none.",
